          <p>
            Tiger Mountain is one of the most distinctive residential areas in the Issaquah region. Rising southeast of the city center, this forested zone features properties ranging from modest cabins on wooded lots to expansive custom homes on multi-acre parcels. The roads wind through Douglas fir and western red cedar forests, and many driveways run hundreds of feet from the public road to the residence.
          </p>
          <p>
