            <li><strong>Property Types:</strong> Acreage homes, cabins, custom estates, and detached workshop/garage structures.</li>
            <li><strong>Typical Electrical Service:</strong> 100A to 200A, overhead PSE utility feeds.</li>
            <li><strong>Common Repair Demands:</strong> Panel upgrades, long-distance circuit runs, detached building subpanels, and surge protection.</li>
            <li><strong>Special Considerations:</strong> Overhead power vulnerability, well pump loads, gravel/uneven terrain for trenching.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

